                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c667cb78-00bd-4158-90d4-c6b8340e229a",
                        "entry_id": "d99d6cac-31bd-3760-9c57-258b0f72c8cb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "orantes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1c62845-cab8-317f-b3c0-251b1b277e8f",
                        "entry_id": "d99d6cac-31bd-3760-9c57-258b0f72c8cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est en prière ; qui prie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07a4cbc0-afdc-4b62-9f4c-23baefbe0351",
                                "sense_id": "a1c62845-cab8-317f-b3c0-251b1b277e8f",
                                "text": "Toute la vie de l'ermite est contenue dans cette tension vers Dieu, cette attention de l'âme orante pour la fidélité de laquelle les anciens moines d’Égypte avaient inventé l'oraison jaculatoire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f1915f9-57e5-4199-b197-d127f86abf4f",
                                "sense_id": "a1c62845-cab8-317f-b3c0-251b1b277e8f",
                                "text": "René et l’abbé traversent la nef à pas feutrés et découvrent le père curé, légèrement à leur droite, orant, agenouillé sur un prie-Dieu, seul dans l’église, face à un Christ enchâssé dans une niche de pierre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "55782562-e6f5-3448-a074-df426b7c3e5d",
                "word": "orant",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d757a651-0369-4a97-b2f8-bbb0b4cb802e",
                        "entry_id": "55782562-e6f5-3448-a074-df426b7c3e5d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "orants"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a46fb481-5772-4a34-8fe0-c4375e0f9deb",
                        "entry_id": "55782562-e6f5-3448-a074-df426b7c3e5d",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "orante"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf3117ff-582c-369a-8640-5d5e8964210c",
                        "entry_id": "55782562-e6f5-3448-a074-df426b7c3e5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne en prière."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b06a4f0b-0d35-4178-bab3-a3aae605f4e8",
                                "sense_id": "cf3117ff-582c-369a-8640-5d5e8964210c",
                                "text": "Et nous devrions lui en savoir gré car son sujet qui porte sur la guerre et sur un siège et, par conséquent, sur un problème de virilité supérieure, se passerait avantageusement de cette déliquescence qu’est la prière, laquelle représente la situation de soumission la plus extrême puisque l’orant s’y abandonne sans lutte, s’étant livré à Dieu une bonne fois pour toutes"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a7bb199-44ea-4ab0-a084-b50d648269b2",
                                "sense_id": "cf3117ff-582c-369a-8640-5d5e8964210c",
                                "text": "La Salât n'est pas une prière de demande, qui se dit en arabe du'â et qui n'est pas nécessaire à sa validité, mais elle inclut la prière de demande laissée au choix de l’orant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de40220b-a8f4-4a3f-bf02-8110bf67ac6a",
                                "sense_id": "cf3117ff-582c-369a-8640-5d5e8964210c",
                                "text": "Ce ne sont pas quelques mètres qui séparent les orants de la ville ; c'est tout un monde."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a0e2c96-56a2-48a5-a535-551b40abab60",
                        "source_entry_id": "55782562-e6f5-3448-a074-df426b7c3e5d",
                        "source_sense_id": "cf3117ff-582c-369a-8640-5d5e8964210c",
                        "target_lang_word": "prayer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prayer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70950d14-28c0-3b06-853c-e5b61c8b274d",
                                        "entry_id": "50252dde-cf62-3d2d-87c4-c7bca9aeb715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A practice of communicating with one's God, or with some spiritual entity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea8266bc-4962-47cb-885a-7ad5ba56484b",
                                                "sense_id": "70950d14-28c0-3b06-853c-e5b61c8b274d",
                                                "text": "Through prayer I ask for God's guidance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe35dcfb-a73d-4dc9-845f-57319a1d33b6",
                                                "sense_id": "70950d14-28c0-3b06-853c-e5b61c8b274d",
                                                "text": "In many cultures, prayer involves singing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5eb9700d-d484-334a-8883-ac64330a940f",
                                        "entry_id": "50252dde-cf62-3d2d-87c4-c7bca9aeb715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of praying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1abd61ac-c147-4957-a274-62b686ee8921",
                                                "sense_id": "5eb9700d-d484-334a-8883-ac64330a940f",
                                                "text": "Then everybody once more knelt, and soon the blessing was pronounced. The choir and the clergy trooped out slowly, […], down the nave to the western door. […] At a seemingly immense distance the surpliced group stopped to say the last prayer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f28ad0e-6e76-47f5-ab05-f3a75b788d05",
                                                "sense_id": "5eb9700d-d484-334a-8883-ac64330a940f",
                                                "text": "In that spirit, we’ll close with the wish we always offer at the end of our annual review, although this time it’s more of a prayer: Happy new year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fc0af9d-eca8-3a6d-8a9a-13d198f3b3a9",
                                        "entry_id": "50252dde-cf62-3d2d-87c4-c7bca9aeb715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The specific words or methods used for praying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9d55c18-3a16-4f55-acb9-f787c81113e2",
                                                "sense_id": "3fc0af9d-eca8-3a6d-8a9a-13d198f3b3a9",
                                                "text": "Christians recite the Lord's Prayer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26a58acb-ebd1-4640-a050-117de575d2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "3fc0af9d-eca8-3a6d-8a9a-13d198f3b3a9",
                                                "text": "For Baha'is, there's a difference between obligatory prayers and devotional prayers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "643f0274-a1a4-3d5e-afcd-18ffbc0ed11e",
                                        "entry_id": "50252dde-cf62-3d2d-87c4-c7bca9aeb715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A meeting held for the express purpose of praying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86e8bc97-4afc-46eb-96a5-515871550f80",
                                                "sense_id": "643f0274-a1a4-3d5e-afcd-18ffbc0ed11e",
                                                "text": "Grandpa never misses a chance to go to prayer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ef073cd-65f5-30d8-a313-f2ce6da2af0a",
                                        "entry_id": "50252dde-cf62-3d2d-87c4-c7bca9aeb715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A request; a petition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c01a4b9-7010-41c5-af9d-04442ac033e4",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef073cd-65f5-30d8-a313-f2ce6da2af0a",
                                                "text": "This, your honor, is my prayer; that all here be set free."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68cbd2be-4a1f-3cdd-9677-8f5577f32be9",
                                        "entry_id": "50252dde-cf62-3d2d-87c4-c7bca9aeb715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The remotest hope or chance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "singular",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81323d2f-db97-4287-a990-70c3c6fe3be8",
                                                "sense_id": "68cbd2be-4a1f-3cdd-9677-8f5577f32be9",
                                                "text": "That team doesn't have a prayer of winning the championship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "prayer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b858c09a-7a07-313a-9ace-33a3c3667aa0",
                                        "entry_id": "9ae6db37-41ae-3ecb-9342-b4c616c5ff92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who prays."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5f2d0f1-daed-4c57-8804-e77cfc40c9e6",
                                                "sense_id": "b858c09a-7a07-313a-9ace-33a3c3667aa0",
                                                "text": "If you are a dreamer, a wisher, a liar / A hope-er^([sic]), a pray-er^([sic]), a magic bean buyer…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a261876-bcd9-4b90-9859-7b4a976105a7",
                                                "sense_id": "b858c09a-7a07-313a-9ace-33a3c3667aa0",
                                                "text": "Out of the 37 respondents, seven are infrequent prayers who prefer to leave the precise details of their prayer life ambiguous."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
